<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Release clauses. War chests. Amortisation.=
 Transfer requests. Surplus to requirements. Online meltdowns. Agents. Gazu=
mping. Buy-back clauses. Options. Add-ons. Personal terms. Soft approaches.=
 Grifters. Clickbait. Lowball bids. In The Knows. Serious bids. Super agent=
s. Hijacked bids. Agreements in principle. Medicals. Undisclosed fees. Part=
 exchanges. Deal sheets. Here we gos! Done deals. Some busker strumming a g=
uitar in the Sky Sports News studio while reminiscing about Deadline Days <=
em>passim</em> through the medium of song. No really, some busker strumming=
 a guitar in the Sky Sports News studio while etc, and so on. After a near =
relentless onslaught of media buzzwords, hype and assorted reputable (and t=
horoughly disreputable) transfer insiders announcing they =E2=80=9Cundersta=
nd=E2=80=9D things, the summer transfer window <a href=3D"https://ablink.ed=
itorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSneH=
EBgtjhYSJYcaNsDra0BxnPgCXMBtR4eW1xnhEVKaWZV81dOxci4eH2y_vQ6dZ13AiRkKdTNbeN5=
fr5DRzuEG8WvI57aDjRYFVYjZLTAu1NYgik42JbA1165dwaIqQ_y8uHXciDkeAKXRJURzvcq88g=
V0yr0G9g1qTfyKikMrIKEbIw9Reodlghtqn-H6Isca1gvoXxxBVWKvNWJ50vQkr4rVea9dkPAp3=
_KckR26vyLX-o3ludPdfsmr5T4ysOMbktCIq5vQohXI4uJ6fZwhUFs/4tp/0UmN0K4FRr6r7sIq=
FTHKSQ/h29/h001.ULTCcWwxrJ2lks5TESfTZt9_4cCyyAH6tmGR3F91wRA" style=3D"color=
: #0077B6;">is finally shut</a>. But what=E2=80=99s that Football Daily can=
 see pressed up against the glass? The out-of-joint nose of an apoplectic D=
avid Moyes.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">While the likes of Liverpool, Aston Villa,=
 Coventry, Crystal Palace, Fulham and Manchester United were all flagged up=
 as clubs who endured the worst summer transfer window by assorted experts =
in one of many deadline day post-mortems perused by Football Daily, we=E2=
=80=99re going to respectfully suggest their opinions were solicited and pr=
epared for publication <em>before</em> news broke on Tuesday night that Fol=
arin Balogun had decided Everton would not be such A Grand Old Team To Play=
 For and absconded from Finch Farm leaving a trail of dust. The USA USA USA=
 striker=E2=80=99s late change of heart when a deal for his transfer from M=
onaco to Merseyside had been all but signed, sealed and delivered is report=
ed to have left Everton insiders =E2=80=9Cshocked=E2=80=9D, =E2=80=9Cdisapp=
ointed=E2=80=9D and with just one out-and-out striker in the form of the en=
dearingly hapless Thierno Barry to see them through until the new year. Ind=
eed, such was the club recruitment department=E2=80=99s determination to ge=
t the Balogun deal over the line, nobody appears to have noticed they only =
have 18 outfield players, not one of whom looks particularly at home at ful=
l-back. While the obvious gag involves a late intervention from the White H=
ouse, whether or not a certain free agent named S=C3=A9amus Coleman can be =
tempted out of his recent retirement remains to be seen.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">While Manchester City=E2=80=99s deadline d=
ay acquisitions of Iliman Ndiaye and Enzo Fern=C3=A1ndez sent Premier Leagu=
e spending during the summer window up towards a record =C2=A33.5bn mark, n=
o last-gasp deal illustrated the sheer obscenity of this unseemly meat-mark=
et more than the tug-of-war between Sunderland and Crystal Palace to secure=
 the services of Malick Fofana from Lyon. A young Belgium winger most fans =
of both clubs probably couldn=E2=80=99t have picked out of a police lineup =
before Tuesday, Fofana was ferried to a French airport where different priv=
ate jets from both clubs had been dispatched to fly him to London or Wearsi=
de, depending on his mood. Cue: the arrival of a third plane containing Sun=
derland=E2=80=99s billionaire owner, who eventually persuaded him to board =
the one festooned with red and white stripes. =E2=80=9CThe club plays an in=
tegral role in economic and environmental change, helping to protect our gr=
eat city from the effects of climate change,=E2=80=9D brags a message that =
can currently be found on the Sunderland website, albeit in a position of f=
ar less prominence than the announcement of their newest recruit. And so un=
til January, when the all the planes refuel and the madness inevitably rest=
arts.</p>
